      "title": {
        "en": "Folder Attach",
        "zh": "文件夹附件"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Drag folders into the DSH web composer instead of hitting 'only the desktop app supports folders': host folder dialog, /folder command, and drag/paste into @path mentions. Works in browser and desktop.",
        "zh": "把文件夹拖进 DSH 网页输入框，提供宿主文件夹对话框、/folder 命令与 @路径 提及，浏览器与桌面端都能用。"
      },
